# (ExpoRoot -> fork/NavigationContainer -> fork/useLinking). Its bundled fork predates the
# React Navigation history traversal fixes below; patching @react-navigation/native would not
# affect that executed path.
#
# Backport the narrowly relevant createMemoryHistory hunks from React Navigation:
# - 5478a62255df8ab34f0847a1392e1e7c02f0d029: reject if the browser did not land on targetId;
# - 51c301ce9a1adecc7e0988735864f61deebc65aa: remove the one-shot popstate handler on timeout;
# - fc82c1b69797d169847f4950fc5f858830c2142f: bounded 1000 ms Firefox fallback.
#
# The current Expo fork lacks the upstream timeout reconciliation, so retain its actual browser
# index after a non-arrival too. Remove this patch when the installed Expo Router fork contains
# the targetId guard, listener cleanup, 1000 ms fallback, and equivalent timeout reconciliation.
